# gui backend test: Layout pl (AltGr Polish letters through the xkb keymap sent to the client). Needs python3 + PySide6.
Window gui
Size 700x500
Layout pl
Title "Qt, Polish keyboard"
Run python3 -I ${AUTODEMO_ROOT}/qtapp.py
WaitFor title "qt:ready" 30s
MouseMove 350 421 300
MouseClick
Send "zażółć gęślą jaźń ĄĆĘŁŃÓŚŹŻ"
WaitFor title "qt:text=zażółć gęślą jaźń ĄĆĘŁŃÓŚŹŻ" 10s
Sleep 500ms
